# Keep JavaScript LF in the repo. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# these to CRLF, and the Workflow tool rejects a `scriptPath` whose file contains CR
# (\r counts as a control character) — which breaks /workflow-review's scriptPath launch
# on Windows. Pinning eol=lf keeps the workflow script launchable everywhere.
*.js text eol=lf
